# Files that are NOT worth a Markdown cache. Same rules as .gitignore; applies to
# this folder and everything under it. Checked by `python check-pdf-cache.py`.

# 32 pages of numeric factor tables. `pdftotext -layout` misaligns the columns, so
# values land under the wrong `n` -- and a silently wrong factor is worse than no
# cache at all. Read the specific PDF page instead; the page map is in INDEX.md.
lecture/Chapter+2+-+COMPOUND+INTEREST+TABLES.pdf
